<h1>Inbox to Action — Existing Epic APIs by Row</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Mapped against the live Epic API Catalog (41 services / 279 endpoints, refreshed 2026-07-16) &middot; Companion to "Inbox to Action | Problem Space &amp; Priority Stack"</p>

<div class="note">
Each row below lists the Epic API endpoints that already exist to support that row's capability, verified directly against the API Catalog MCP rather than assumed. Confirmed gaps (no matching endpoint found anywhere in the catalog) are called out in <span class="gap">red</span>.
</div>

<table>
<colgroup>
  <col class="rownum"><col class="rowname"><col class="apis">
